The P07 assertion is bounded retention plus useful hits. RSS is recorded as
host/process observation only; this sample does not infer why its two fresh
processes have different starting RSS values or claim a bytes-per-shape law.

Concurrency context: other package agents were active; root advised that WP1
or flexible-package unit work could overlap. No other benchmark was launched
by this worker, so elapsed values are not comparative timing evidence.
